<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch PTT says may seek separate listings.</title>
<headline>Dutch PTT says may seek separate listings.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch post and telecoms group PTT Nederland NV said on Tuesday it was &quot;quite possible&quot; that it would seek separate bourse listings for its post and telecommunications businesses.</p>
<p>Earlier on Tuesday PTT Nederland said it planned to split itself up into two separate companies but its statement made no mention of separate listings.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
